<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Στύξ</span></b> , ἡ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Στῠγός, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
			Styx</i>, i.e. <i>the Hateful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.369
			</span></i>: also the nymph of this river, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				361
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a well of fatal coldness in Arcadia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				8.18.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Appellat., <i>monster, reptile</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρωτον . . ὑπὸ στυγός </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στύγος</span> cod.M) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				532
			</span></i> (sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στύγους</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>piercing chill, as of frost</i>, in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ στύγες εἰσδύονται εἰς τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					5.14.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>hatred, abhorrence</i>, esp. of mankind, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκώψ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				21.5
			</span></i>, Hygin. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fab.</u>
				28.4
			</span></i> Rose, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρίξ</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
